tures per type + a SOUND fixture for anti-confabulation), rubric/tolerance scored, plus A/B vs a generic \"review this\" baseline on must-find recall.\n\n**The protocol pipeline (the SKILL.md spec)**\n- TRIAGE â†’ FRAME deep-structure â†’ TYPE-APPROPRIATE LENS â†’ CROSS-CUTTING DIAGNOSIS with forcing functions (D1 widen to â‰¥N readings incl. â‰¥1 inverting; D2 disconfirm; D3 events-vs-structure only if a system) â†’ OPERATOR-WRONG PASS â†’ THREE-CHANNEL REPORT (what's-going-on / what-matters / what's-wrong) â†’ SCOPE-HONEST EVIDENCE labeling.\n\n**Machine-checkable non-goals (anti-drift invariants)**\n- NOT a rewriter (schema = analysis, not replacement); NOT the Shark Tank (**must** be able to emit zero Channel-2 defects + populated what-matters â€” a \"sound\" verdict is valid); NOT researchPrime (no self-CORROBORATED; unverifiable â†’ needs_verification).\n- Structural rules: every finding has a non-empty `location_span`; reasoning precedes verdict; `load_bearing` is a ranked list **â‰¥0** (not pinned to 1); must emit `what_would_change_my_conclusion` + `residual_uncertainty`; nitpicks capped per depth; `operator_wrong_pass` always present (found[] or justified_absence); a \"sound/pass\" verdict **requires** populated what-matters (no empty flattery).\n\n**Residual decisions reserved for Stage 2 pre-registration**\n- N (hypothesis count), nitpick cap, LIGHT/FULL depth thresholds, the canary pass-bar vs generic baseline + run-count for significance, committed schema field types, and the operator-wrong-pass scoring rubric.\n\n---\n**One grounding caveat:** the prompt's title and anchors map to the **diagnose-core** plan (`planning/crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, G1â€“G5). There is a *separate, parallel* \"full deep-think advisor\" Master Plan (`planning/crucible-advisor/MASTER-PLAN.md`, v2 post-Shark-R1) that keeps the deferred SITUATE/ANTICIPATE/ELEVATE scope alive as three decoupled increments. If your intended target was that full-advisor plan rather than the core, tell me and I'll re-summarize against it."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3589,"cache_read_input_tokens":40165,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3589},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba2d1ee5-0a15-41ff-beda-07fd1f12224d","uuid":"352c7c9b-7b8b-4d4c-b83b-7b43b0aa66f7","request_id":"req_011CcFpG1CJtRAF24ukGaiWM"}
